OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cold morning, with icy
OL,6,Fstretches in the north potentially
OL,7,Fdisrupting travel. Long sunny spells
OL,8,Ffor many, but lingering cloud and
OL,9,Fshowers in the east and wintry showers
OL,10,Ffor northern Scotland. Cloudy in the
OL,11,Fsouth and west, heavy rain later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FWintry showers continue in
OL,14,Fthe far northeast. Elsewhere there
OL,15,Fwill be persistent rain, and snow for
OL,16,Fnorthern hills. Generally breezy, but
OL,17,Fstrong winds over hills and gales
OL,18,Falong some coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
