OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FWet and windy. Heavy,
OL,6,Fpossibly thundery, showers for the
OL,7,Fsouth with strong winds. Cold with
OL,8,Fpersistent rain across the north
OL,9,Fgenerally, though northern Scotland
OL,10,Fwill be brighter and showery.
